Package: gauntlet
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Gauntlet maintainers <https://github.com/GodSpeedAI/Gauntlet>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Recommends: postgresql, bubblewrap
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/GodSpeedAI/Gauntlet
Description: reference-anchored runtime for governed agent work (CLI + operator workbench)
 Gauntlet runs the Reference -> Transform -> Observe -> Compare -> Verify ->
 Select -> Correct -> Settle -> Remember loop against frozen references and
 records durable evidence for every settlement. This package installs the
 standalone `gauntlet` command-line runtime and, when built and launch-
 qualified on this platform, the `gauntlet-workbench` terminal operator
 surface. A PostgreSQL server is REQUIRED (point GAUNTLET_DATABASE_URL at
 it); bubblewrap (sandbox) and bun (codemode tool-program host) are optional
 capabilities, reported honestly by `gauntlet doctor`. No post-install
 script runs and no service is enabled: installing does not start anything.
